  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feminist AI: How to develop inclusive, local approach to AI for humanitarian aid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exploring how Artificial Intelligence (AI) can transform the way we do humanitarian diplomacy to better represent marginalised communities. The aim is to learn how to ensure that the development of AI systems based on large data volumes can include knowledge and perspectives from those who have not contributed to that data.</narrative>
  </description>
